prompt_template:
[SOURCE: contact-form] [PRIORITY: high] [TYPE: lead]
Name: {{payload.name}}
Email: {{payload.email}}
Message: {{payload.message}}
Form submitted: {{payload.submitted_at}}

[SOURCE: transcript-worker] [TYPE: session-recap] [PRIORITY: normal]

Enrichment directory: {{payload.enrich_dir}}
Transcript note: {{payload.transcript_note}}
Meeting summary file: {{payload.summary_file}}

Process this session recap for review and distribution.

[SOURCE: zoom-class] [TYPE: recording.completed] [PRIORITY: low]

Zoom recording.completed observed by the push lane. The hourly poll-mode `zoom-recording-scan` job is the primary processor and is idempotent against the manifest, so this envelope is informational unless the cron lapsed.

uuid: {{payload.payload.object.uuid}}
meeting_id: {{payload.payload.object.id}}
host_email: {{payload.payload.object.host_email}}
topic: {{payload.payload.object.topic}}
start_time: {{payload.payload.object.start_time}}
duration_min: {{payload.payload.object.duration}}
account_id: {{payload.payload.account_id}}

Acknowledge with a one-line note. No further action unless the next hourly scan also misses this UUID — then escalate to chief.

[SOURCE: {{payload.source}}] [SEVERITY: {{payload.severity}}] [TYPE: {{payload.alert_type}}]

Message: {{payload.error_message}}
Timestamp: {{payload.timestamp}}

Failed records: {{payload.failed_records}}

Original payload:
{{payload.original_payload}}

This is an alert from the gads conversion pipeline. Acknowledge with one line if `severity=warn`. For `error` post a brief root-cause hypothesis. For `critical` page Alex via PushOver.
